AuthorDate: Thu Apr 2 22:06:57 2026 +0000
Commit:     John Bieling <john@thunderbird.net>
CommitDate: Thu Apr 2 22:06:57 2026 +0000

    Bug 2028370 - Add missing WebExtension API descriptions. r=mkmelin

    This patch is adding some missing API descriptions to our schema files.

    In addition, this patch updates our annotation files and adds missing enum
    descriptions (the schema files do not support enum descriptions) and missing
    API descriptions for Mozilla APIs (we have no control over their schema files
    and using our annotation system is much more flexible than asking them to
    accept patches to their schema files).

    This is almost a no-code patch, since most of the changes affect only the
    annotation files, which are not affecting any code. It does touch a few
    schema files, but adding descriptions is not a risk.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D291411

